log log.lammps
read_restart restart.rst
kspace_style pppm 1e-6
dielectric 1.0
special_bonds amber
pair_modify mix arithmetic
neighbor 2.0 bin

timestep 1.0
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
fix shake_benchmark all shake 1e-4 1000 0 m 1.0
fix md_benchmark all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0

thermo_style custom step time temp press density etotal
thermo_modify flush yes
thermo 1000
run 3000

unfix md_benchmark
unfix shake_benchmark
quit
